# Graphics Effects Simulation System

## Problem Description
You are tasked with implementing a graphics system simulator that manages and renders various visual effects. The system should support multiple effect types with configurable parameters, allow toggling effects on/off, and simulate the rendering process.

## Class Requirements
Implement the following classes exactly as specified:

### `EffectType` Enum
```cpp
enum class EffectType {
    PLASMA,
    DISTORT,
    FIRE,
    WAVE,
    PARTICLES,
    NONE
};
```

### `EffectConfig` Struct
```cpp
struct EffectConfig {
    EffectType type;
    float intensity;
    float speed;
    float scale;
    bool enabled;
};
```

### `GraphicsSystem` Class
```cpp
class GraphicsSystem {
private:
