   - Should allow upgrading session options and status
   - Should provide session summary information
   - Should automatically update last access time on any modification

2. **SessionManager Class**:
   - Should create new sessions with unique IDs
   - Should retrieve valid sessions and update their access time
   - Should clean up expired sessions
   - Should list all active sessions with their summaries

## Example Usage
