## Problem Description
You are tasked with implementing an `Armor` class for a role-playing game inventory system. The class should model different types of armor with various properties including defense values, material types, durability, and magical enhancements.

## Class Requirements
Implement the `Armor` class with the following exact specifications:

### Enums
```cpp
enum class ArmorType { LIGHT, MEDIUM, HEAVY };
enum class Material { LEATHER, CHAINMAIL, PLATE, SCALE, PADDED };
```

### Private Member Variables
