    void repair(int amount);
    void takeDamage(int damage);

    // Calculation and display
    float getEffectiveDefense() const;
    string getTypeString() const;
    string getMaterialString() const;
    void displayInfo() const;
```

## Functionality Requirements
1. The class should automatically calculate armor worth based on defense value, material, and magic status
2. Durability should be maintained between 0 and maxDurability (100)
3. Effective defense should be calculated based on durability and magic modifiers
4. The class should provide string representations of armor types and materials
5. Each armor piece should have a unique auto-incrementing ID

## Example Usage
```cpp
int main() {
